      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793210645729,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Job 2 always happens: Compose looks for .env in\nthe folder you run it from, with or without\nenv_file.\n\nJob 1 only happens with env_file: .env. Without\nit, the app gets nothing from the file.\n\nWho wins for ${...}: the terminal (WEB_PORT=5000\ndocker compose up), then .env, then the default\nafter :-",
      "originalText": "Job 2 always happens: Compose looks for .env in\nthe folder you run it from, with or without\nenv_file.\n\nJob 1 only happens with env_file: .env. Without\nit, the app gets nothing from the file.\n\nWho wins for ${...}: the terminal (WEB_PORT=5000\ndocker compose up), then .env, then the default\nafter :-",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "zczbttof7jyu",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
